title: "doehelper: A Design of Experiments (DOE) helper tool"
abstract: >-
  A command-line Design of Experiments helper tool that guides users
  through the full experimental workflow: designing experiments,
  generating runner scripts, recording results, statistical analysis,
  optimization, and reporting.
type: software
